   3:Core/Src/app.c ****   * @file    Core/Src/app.c
   4:Core/Src/app.c ****   * @brief   FreeRTOS 5-Task GPS Map & Navigation Application Orchestrator:
   5:Core/Src/app.c ****   *            1. Sensor_Input_Task (Core/Src/sensor_input_task.c, Prio 3)
